window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>When Jenny Watkins buys an old fixer-upper with her husband, Greg, she is quickly haunted by a voice that only she can hear. The message the voice conveys prompts Jenny to look into the history of the house, which was the scene of a disappearance 60 years earlier. During her investigation, she is introduced to a cast of characters who ultimately change the way Jenny looks at life. </p> <p>This inspiring story offers believable characters, an intriguing plot, and plenty of humor throughout. The first book in a promising new series, <i>Driven</i> is sure to leave listeners looking for more.</p>"; 
